WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:06.079
SpaceXAI was subpoenaed. On 16 October, it
came.

00:00:08.029 --> 00:00:12.507
By video. It sent a government-affairs
manager.

00:00:13.557 --> 00:00:18.936
Its catastrophe insurance? The manager was
"not aware of the specifics".

00:00:19.986 --> 00:00:25.364
If its AI causes a death? "We're
responsible for following the law."

00:00:26.414 --> 00:00:31.793
How many work on safety? "Everybody is in
charge of safety."

00:00:32.743 --> 00:00:36.129
Odds of catastrophe: no number given.

00:00:36.579 --> 00:00:41.050
Everybody is in charge of safety. The
headcount will follow.
